{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22502","headline":"和钱员外荅卢员外早春独游曲江见寄长句 · 白居易","name":"和钱员外荅卢员外早春独游曲江见寄长句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春来有色闇融融，先到诗情酒思中。\n柳岸霏微裛尘雨，杏园澹荡开花风。\n闻君独游心郁郁，薄晚新晴骑马出。\n醉思诗侣有同年，春叹翰林无暇日。\n云夫首倡寒玉音，蔚章继和春搜吟。\n此时我亦闭门坐，一日风光三处心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22502.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22502","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}